## Usage

Add the plugin to your Maven `pom.xml`:

```xml
<build>
    <plugins>
        <plugin>
            <groupId>com.example</groupId>
            <artifactId>notnull-checker-maven-plugin</artifactId>
            <version>1.0.0</version>
            <executions>
                <execution>
                    <goals>
                        <goal>check-notnull</goal>
                    </goals>
                </execution>
            </executions>
        </plugin>
    </plugins>
</build>